        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: નવડાવવું",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "નવડાવવું — navḍāvvũ — \"to bathe someone\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "માતા રોજ સવારે બાળકને નવડાવે છે. mātā roj savāre bāḷakne navḍāve che. The mother bathes the baby every morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે બાળકને નવડાવ્યું, teṇe bāḷakne navḍāvyũ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "નવડાવવું (navḍāvvũ) is the causative of નાહવું (nāhvũ), \"to bathe\", which is inherited from Sanskrit snāti, \"bathes\" (CDIAL 13786)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
